Save it
For Compilation

H:/>Online_Shop>truffle compile

It will create a .json file in the build folder.
Once compiled, open ganache, select the truffle-config.js file and start the new workspace.

After that migrate the project to ganache as follows
H:/>Online_Shop>truffle migrate – - reset – -network development

It will move the project to ganache
Next interact with the project as follows
1.	let shop1=await OnlineShop.deployed();
2.	await shop1.addProduct("Shoes", web3.utils.toWei("0.5", "ether"))
3.	await shop1.addProduct("Laptop", web3.utils.toWei("0.5", "ether"))
4.	await shop1.addProduct("watch", web3.utils.toWei("0.5", "ether"))
5.	let all = await shop1.showProducts()
6.	truffle(development)> all
7.	await shop1.buyProduct(1, {from: accounts[1], value: web3.utils.toWei("0.5", "ether")})
8.	all = await shop1.showProducts()
